    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a strange living room. A haunting and beautiful melody plays far off in the distance. It seems vaguely familiar, but - where am I? What do I do? \u201cReality\u201d is a 3D mystery that implores you to search for secrets and notice details of your surroundings in a surreal and minimal dream world. It\u2019s up to you to explore this ethereal environment, uncover abstract puzzles, and piece together the meaning behind your new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Unique FM Skyline Aesthetic</strong>: Immerse yourself in a beautifully minimal world that reflects the artistic vision of FM Skyline\u2019s music and design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Abstract Puzzles</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles that require careful thought and exploration, pushing you to uncover hidden layers of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Surreal Atmosphere</strong>: an enchanting and ethereal visual world and soundscape creates an immersive, otherworldly experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mystery of Reality\u2014where sound and dreamlike visuals collide, crafted by FM Skyline and brought to life by 100% Electronica.</p>",
